 "description": "Please help me find focus for this Senate/Fleet/Ground deck.",
 "strategy": "I don't really know what this deck does.  Surprisingly, initial play test have been pretty good.  Since it has no clear focus, except Senators arguing (usually with themselves) in the Senate (and that not very important), there's nothing to disrupt.  I've just been waiting for my opponent to reveal their game plan, then doing whatever I can to mess it up.  And with 3 lightsabers, as many a 5 battle destinies sometimes and 17 Star Destroyers, there's a lot of messing up power in this deck.\n\nSo, what do you think?  How can it be improved?",
